          "fields": {
            "rarity": "Rare",
            "type": "Mission"
          },
          "text": "At the end of the Third Denizens of Abundance War, Reignbow Arbiter's Sky-Shattering Lux Arrow wiped out everything along the way. The Xianzhou people used the "
