          "art": "../../Database/GameData/hsr/assets/items/140603.webp",
          "fields": {
            "rarity": "Rare",
            "type": "Mission"
          },
          "text": "From the \"Weaver of Romance\": Aglaea's bestowal, symbolizing her unchanging selflessness and temperance beneath her aloof perfection."
